<title>FRANCE: Pernod-Ricard happy with 5.0 pct rise.</title>
<headline>Pernod-Ricard happy with 5.0 pct rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pernod-Ricard chairman Patrick Ricard said on Tuesday that he would be &quot;happy&quot; with a five percent increase in the 1997 pre-tax, pre-exceptional profit, &quot;taking account of the stock surplus of the end of 1996.&quot;</p>
<p>He told the annual general meeting the sales figure at the end of March was up by some four to five percent.</p>
</text>
